{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（4日）下午近2時，長沙灣蘇屋邨百合樓有人疑失足墮樓。一名年約50多歲的男子，由上址大廈一低層單位的窗口墮樓，跌落大廈平台位置，途人發現報警求助。</p><p>消防員到場將男事主由平台救下，發現他半清醒無法應答，於是由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院搶救，警方正調查其墮樓原因及經過。</p><p>據悉，涉事單位住有一名獨居多年的中年漢，事發時有人在4樓一個單位爬出窗外，企圖撿拾窗台位置的物品。期間疑有人不慎失足，飛墮大廈對開平台位置。</p><figure><img alt=\"蘇屋邨百合樓一低層單位有人疑失足墮樓。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194661620123570176169028.jpeg/f5uuEE31WtiqOVOP7GzB8bIV20fw0P44CqrTzC-q08w\"/><figcaption>蘇屋邨百合樓一低層單位有人疑失足墮樓。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場將傷者由平台救下。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194661617271312384594738.jpeg/ina6_j7p-ycYIbtT4INBto1NdcXuHYCAAKDz8iWg8_I\"/><figcaption>消防到場將傷者由平台救下。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場蘇屋邨百合樓。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194662348191698944362784.jpeg/bxFPHl05IYblDbWzM_g6FS9wGo23jdwRmCIf0b0iH9E\"/><figcaption>現場蘇屋邨百合樓。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員上樓調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194662352096727040140276.jpeg/_LIw2zVlbA5kBdVikk0sPdeYyFUsyfyruE8w751PMO8\"/><figcaption>警員上樓調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260401/1115956957354659840419873.jpeg/UVZZHihXxnaXoF4CKoOABlcX6AzyDNQgDvwACg78AAo\"/><figcaption>傷者由救護車送往瑪嘉烈醫院。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T07:25:58.953923+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":300,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T07:12:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:58:47.786641+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:18:59.206433+00:00","content_hash":"eb3ab620f69f4f126ce2fbdae174e11d435b14acb9e935bc737d09744fcea042","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}